# ==============================================================================
# NAVA -- Git Ignore Rules
# Strict Rule: Only pure production/test source code and build scripts go to GitHub.
# Internal planning, AI agent constitutions, local spikes, models, and secrets
# MUST NEVER be committed or pushed to remote repositories.
# ==============================================================================

